regression_nested_if_statement:
       |
       | LABEL_1:
     1 |           MOVE                VREG 2, IMM 10
     2 |           JUMP                LABEL_2
       |
       | LABEL_2:
     3 |           JUMP                LABEL_3
       |
       | LABEL_3:
     4 |           MOVE                VREG 3, IMM 21
     5 |           MOVE                RAX, VREG 3
     6 |           RETURN
